<title>FRANCE: French budget minister loses seat.</title>
<headline>French budget minister loses seat.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>French budget minister and government spokesman Alain Lamassoure was squeezed out of his seat in the parliamentary election runoff on Sunday, official results showed.</p>
<p>Lamassoure polled 49.27 percent of the votes in his Pyrenees constituency, losing narrowly to Socialist candidate Nicole Pery on 50.73 percent.</p>
